    {
      "s": "While both words are severely outdated, curple means butt and hirple means to hobble or limp.",
      "t": "A",
      "v": "761820_1",
      "n": "ExplanationAudio"
    },
    {
      "s": "And to the great people of Scotland, my sincerest apologies.",
      "t": "A",
      "v": "761821_5",
      "n": "JokeAudio"
    },
    {
      "s": "I’m going to tell this girl from Scotland about the time I got kicked in the butt so hard I limped for a week. If I want to pepper in some old-timey Scottish slang, how should I tell the story?",
